                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a15f8e65-2bd3-3c3c-b733-825c6e4e1010",
                        "entry_id": "5db60d8c-329d-3727-ab4a-2f6fcb748f4c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спорт. спортивный снаряд для силовых упражнений, представляющий собой короткий металлический стержень с утяжелениями на концах в виде утолщений или симметрично закрепляемых дисков"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "512409d3-f272-3c5b-b381-6661858dff3d",
                        "entry_id": "5db60d8c-329d-3727-ab4a-2f6fcb748f4c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. какой-либо объект, состоящий из двух частей, соединённых длинной узкой перемычкой"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2700f04-d34c-47a8-9594-109711e1afc1",
                                "sense_id": "512409d3-f272-3c5b-b381-6661858dff3d",
                                "text": "Пусть каким-то способом эту гантель удалось ориентировать так, что стержень, соединяющий обе её шарообразные части, направлен к центру Земли."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bf3a7448-efab-4209-9f82-c14966580397",
                        "source_entry_id": "5db60d8c-329d-3727-ab4a-2f6fcb748f4c",
                        "target_lang_word": "dumbbell",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dumbbell",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ddefcfaa-666f-36c1-adda-8ec4a1de4f2e",
                                        "entry_id": "2a64cb99-ee0b-30f6-8982-39efca1dec40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A weight training implement consisting of a short bar with weight counterpoised on each end."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa037177-b9bf-4b28-9df5-be0057de0f21",
                                                "sense_id": "ddefcfaa-666f-36c1-adda-8ec4a1de4f2e",
                                                "text": "He was exercising with the dumbbells in gym class today."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7328ae5-500b-49c8-be88-ad0080fe36b8",
                                                "sense_id": "ddefcfaa-666f-36c1-adda-8ec4a1de4f2e",
                                                "text": "He also had a room strewn with the toys of the trade and what-have-you: ropes and ironmongery, buoyancy aid and bagpipes, fetid socks and half-eaten haggises, dumbbells and ski-instructor sweaters."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f33b6a1e-8797-4680-a740-e11a1fe619b9",
                                                "sense_id": "ddefcfaa-666f-36c1-adda-8ec4a1de4f2e",
                                                "text": "On the map Gansu is shaped like a dumbbell lying obliquely from east to west. Its best known city is Lanjhou, the capital, and also the gateway to the Silk Road. But we did not go there; we were heading for a relatively unknown city a few hundred miles away from Lanjhou, called Tianshuei."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "87f859be-c4be-36b0-aea5-f0428c1d6059",
                                        "entry_id": "2a64cb99-ee0b-30f6-8982-39efca1dec40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bell with no clapper, used as bell-striking practice or to strike as a form of physical exercise"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "35340871-c8c0-3da6-8f61-52ace56c5ae6",
                                        "entry_id": "2a64cb99-ee0b-30f6-8982-39efca1dec40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A stupid person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dce2d866-b82b-469f-84a2-0d9a674d11f6",
                                                "sense_id": "35340871-c8c0-3da6-8f61-52ace56c5ae6",
                                                "text": "That's fool's gold, you dumbbell. Iron pyrite. Nobody would give you a dime for a ton of it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9e730b70-523e-41b5-8241-cf54c9708945",
                        "source_entry_id": "5db60d8c-329d-3727-ab4a-2f6fcb748f4c",
                        "target_lang_word": "Hantel",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Hantel",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cd772aa1-449d-3ba4-a485-aecbb012cda4",
                                        "entry_id": "00654055-43a6-3f62-b9a4-dc3e3bf0b9a4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Eisenstange beziehungsweise Eisenstab, an deren Enden man scheiben- oder kugelförmige Gewichte angebracht hat"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Fitness"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e74b7fe2-644c-48df-a14c-48f961b752a9",
                                                "sense_id": "cd772aa1-449d-3ba4-a485-aecbb012cda4",
                                                "text": "Der Muskelprotz saß draußen auf der Bank und hob schwitzend seine Hanteln, um vor den Mädchen anzugeben."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18fe1db5-f23f-44f8-9669-497f6fa78f61",
                                                "sense_id": "cd772aa1-449d-3ba4-a485-aecbb012cda4",
                                                "text": "„Von meinem Geburtstagsgeld wollte ich mir in Koblenz Hanteln kaufen, aber zwei waren mir zu teuer, und ich kaufte nur eine.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f5c32985-2787-4e89-a052-f918b8eb683a",
                        "source_entry_id": "5db60d8c-329d-3727-ab4a-2f6fcb748f4c",
